      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together a brief for a client on potential fiscal policy shifts. Can you give me a quick breakdown on wealth taxes? Is a wealth tax an effective way to reduce inequality, or does it just stifle investment and drive capital away?",
